Verification Notes

Detailed verification procedures, test scenarios, acceptance thresholds, datasets, and evidence records shall be established within the AVIA Verification domain.

Verification requirements shall be derived from approved system-specific requirements and lower-level engineering specifications.

No specific execution technology shall be mandated by this objective.
